---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site.config";
// Source: spec/reviewcatcher-legal-pages.md ("AI & Automation Statement" section).
// Strong draft — for solicitor review before final use; not legal advice.
---

<Layout title={`AI Statement | ${siteConfig.name}`} description={`How ${siteConfig.name} uses AI.`}>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <h1>AI &amp; Automation Statement</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: {siteConfig.legal.pagesLastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        We believe in being upfront about how we use automation and artificial intelligence, in
        line with the transparency principles of the EU AI Act and GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2>Where we use AI and automation</h2>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.name} uses automation to schedule and send review-request messages, and uses
        AI to help draft replies to reviews. This is what lets us deliver the service reliably
        and at a price small businesses can afford.
      </p>

      <h2>Human oversight</h2>
      <p>
        AI assists our work; it doesn't run unsupervised. Review responses and message templates
        are set up and overseen by a person, and clients can review or change how their responses
        are handled at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>No significant automated decisions</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use AI to make solely automated decisions that produce legal or similarly
        significant effects about any individual (GDPR Article 22). AI here drafts and schedules
        ordinary customer communications — nothing more.
      </p>

      <h2>Your data and AI</h2>
      <p>
        We do not permit personal data handled through our service to be used to train
        third-party AI models. AI tools are used only to generate the specific output needed to
        deliver the service.
      </p>

      <h2>Talk to a human</h2>
      <p>
        Anyone who receives a message from us can reply to reach a person, and any client can ask
        for a human to handle any part of their account.
      </p>

      <p>
        Questions about our use of AI? Contact{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}>{siteConfig.contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
